/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:5958:—Ippin, master cartographer','防衛','Defender (This creature can''t attack.)','0','7','53',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 20:42:08+09','2025-07-31 20:45:04+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:6055:――リリアナ・ヴェス','"Don''t worry. I''m not going to deprive you of all your secrets. Just your most precious one."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:6269:――光り葉の大ドルイド、トゥイラ','"Study the great spirits of our age and those of the past. Prune secrets from the branching traceries of our lineage."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:7445:	 (47681,13649,1,1,150,176,1,NULL,'','"Our time grows short. If we wish to vanquish the Eldrazi, we must unlock the hedrons'' secrets."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:7566:	 (47717,13684,1,2,150,5,1,NULL,'','Your blood whispers secrets your mind could never comprehend.','盟友 ― (Ｔ),あなたがコントロールするアンタップ状態の同盟者(Ally)を１体タップする：あなたはカードを１枚引き、１点のライフを失う。','Cohort — {Tap}, Tap an untapped Ally you control: You draw a card and you lose 1 life.','4','4','87',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 22:41:20+09','2025-07-31 21:30:38+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:7768:	 (47785,13750,1,3,150,102,1,NULL,'','Some relic hunters have given up exploring and gone to fight the Eldrazi. But I know our work is more important than ever. The secrets we uncover could lead to the world''s salvation.','あなたが各ターンのあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。','Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, draw a card.','2','3','155',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 22:41:24+09','2025-07-31 21:30:50+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:7842:	 (47808,194,1,2,150,74,1,NULL,'','"Long after the land has given up the last of its secrets, there will still be mysteries in the depths of the sea."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:8155:	 (47936,2571,1,3,147,4,1,NULL,'','As the Eldrazi spread, no secret that could give Zendikar''s defenders an advantage was considered too dangerous to seek.','収斂 ― あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の種類数に等しい。','Converge — You draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.','','','120',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 22:43:45+09','2025-07-31 20:39:17+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:9038:	 (48348,9988,1,2,143,35,1,NULL,'','Scholars had puzzled for centuries over the ruins at Tal Terig. Its secrets had always lived within one rune-carved head.','ルーンの苦役者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。','When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.','2','2','238',1,false,0,'2019-03-12 22:45:52+09','2025-07-31 21:21:11+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:9399:	 (48493,18654,1,1,142,21,1,NULL,'「九回目の予防接種の結果も同様だった。 当然、伝染病が拡大する前に標本は安楽死させている。」――― ヴィダルケンの研究メモ.','"The results of our ninth inoculation were the same. The specimen was, of course, euthanized before the contagion could spread."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:9747:	 (48726,4550,1,1,141,89,1,NULL,'','"The most profound secrets lie in the darkest places of the world. It can be prudent to make use of another set of eyes."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:9761:	 (48634,9988,1,1,142,35,1,NULL,'','Scholars had puzzled for centuries over the ruins at Tal Terig. Its secrets had always lived within one rune-carved head.','ルーンの苦役者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。','When Runed Servitor dies, each player draws a card.','2','2','226',1,false,0,'2019-03-13 03:14:50+09','2025-07-31 21:21:11+09'),
