/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:47689:	 (65177,8110,1,3,203,33,1,NULL,'','The Abzan turn to this spell only as a last resort, for its inevitable result is what they most dread: to be alone.','','','','','154',0,false,0,'2019-03-15 21:46:04+09','2025-07-31 21:14:30+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:47783:	 (65208,17604,1,1,203,286,1,NULL,'ディミーアの印は秘密のギルドの紋章であり、それを見ることのできるのは自分たちの仲間たち ――― そして消し去られる運命の者だけだ。','An emblem of a secret guild, the Dimir insignia is seen only by its own members?and the doomed.','{1}, {Tap}：{Blue}{Black}を加える。','{1}, {Tap}: Add {Blue}{Black}.','','','185',0,false,0,'2019-03-15 21:46:06+09','2025-07-31 21:37:46+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:48123:	 (65349,994,1,3,159,90,2,NULL,'','The results of Rashmi''s experimentation forced her to consider the possibility that multitudinous realities existed beyond her own.','望む数のあなたがコントロールする土地でもトークンでもないパーマネントを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。これによりあなたの手札に戻されたカード１枚につき、カードを１枚引く。','Return any number of target nonland, nontoken permanents you control to their owners'' hands. Draw a card for each card returned to your hand this way.','','','60',1,true,0,'2019-03-15 22:07:03+09','2025-07-31 20:34:38+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:48951:	 (65599,13750,1,3,150,102,2,NULL,'','Some relic hunters have given up exploring and gone to fight the Eldrazi. But I know our work is more important than ever. The secrets we uncover could lead to the world''s salvation.','あなたが各ターンのあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、カードを１枚引く。','Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, draw a card.','2','3','155',1,true,0,'2019-03-15 22:31:14+09','2025-07-31 21:30:50+09'),
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/app/DoctrineMigrations/sql/mtb_card_detail_2.sql:49071:	 (65638,2571,1,3,147,4,2,NULL,'','As the Eldrazi spread, no secret that could give Zendikar''s defenders an advantage was considered too dangerous to seek.','収斂 ― あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の種類数に等しい。','Converge — You draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the number of colors of mana spent to cast this spell.','','','120',1,true,0,'2019-03-15 22:33:46+09','2025-07-31 20:39:17+09'),
